**評量 `GET /api/v1/learning-records`**  
老師同樣是依 `TeacherID`（以及自己仍存在的 `StudentClass`）篩選；`branch_id`／`campus_id` 的分校篩選**只對非老師**生效：

```49:88:backend/app/Http/Controllers/LearningRecordController.php
        if ($role === 'teacher') {
            $teacherId = $request->attributes->get('auth_teacher_id');
            // ...
            $query->where('TeacherID', $teacherId);
            $teacherClassIds = StudentClass::where('TeacherID', $teacherId)->pluck('ID');
            // ...
        }

        if ($role !== 'teacher' && ($request->filled('branch_id') || $request->filled('campus_id'))) {
